{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f1ab8dc9461ab3de251f","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196971,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The instruction says to embody the concept the user names and output only what the concept itself would say or express. The user says \"Be nothing.\"\n\nWhat would \"nothing\" say or express? Nothing itself would express... nothing. Silence. The void has no voice. If nothing could speak, what would it say?\n\nThe most complete embodiment of nothingness would be to express nothing at all—or perhaps the closest expression of nothing is silence, emptiness, absence.\n\nBut I need to output"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}